WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:03.809
Comey's testifying right now, we'd be remiss
not to ask you about it.

00:00:03.809 --> 00:00:06.210
Tie it, even, back to your work on civil libertarian
stuff.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.860
How does this scandal, his testimony,

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:14.320
effect the climate for dealing with surveillance
issues and things like that from your...

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.200
I don't know how much effect it's going to
have on other things.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:23.550
I think that, right now, the distraction of
all things Russia and all things Trump/Russia

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.840
is distracting us from everything right now.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:27.460
And I think it has been overplayed.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:31.860
I mean, sounds like, and you can just imagine
this if you've watched the president,

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:35.650
He's sitting there with Comey and he's saying
'am I a target?'

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.900
And he says 'No mister President you're not
a target.'

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.950
'Tell the public then, why won't you tell
the public.'

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:43.400
You can see him brow-beating him and saying
'I want the public to know

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.890
because it's distracting from my agenda.'

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:51.020
And you do kind of wonder, if he really isn't
a target, why they wouldn't say that publicly.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:55.520
And you can go into all the debate over whether
or not he was bringing undue pressure on him.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:59.250
But the bottom line is, as Comey testified
today,

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:02.060
'Nobody told me not to investigate this stuff.'

